Subject: Best way to compute log score in INLA ($marginals versus inla.posterior.sample)
Message-ID: <7uBoKYkHecg.2B0PSln0AAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/7uBoKYkHecg/m/2B0PSln0AAAJ>
